      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start, but i noticed the marketing tool is only flagging this as a 'low value' email because the feature count is pretty low (it looks like you only hit about 7 or 8 unique ones). \n\ncan you expand on this? we really need that score to be much higher so the marketing team approves the campaign. just try to weave in as many of the features from that list as possible so the automation tool sees it as a high-value, feature-rich message. please try to get the score up!",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
